===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|fibre|glass}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈfaɪbəɡlɑːs/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|fi|bre|glass}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}} {{lb|en|British spelling}}

# [[silica|Silica]] based glass [[extrude]]d into [[fiber]]s that possess a length at least 1000 times greater than their width.
# {{ellipsis of|en|fibreglass wool}}
# A [[composite material]] made from [[fine]] [[fibre]]s of [[spun]] [[glass]] held together with [[resin]].

